// Editor fragment — the Python gate's contribution to the repo's editor
// settings. `/vwf:init` merges every `.config/vscode.d/*.jsonc` into the two
// editor files inside one marked block; a key written by hand after that block
// wins.
//
// The extension recommendation only. No `settings`: this pack runs ruff
// through `uv run` so the gate uses the version the lockfile pinned, and the
// editor keys that would pick an interpreter or a ruff binary are a repo's own
// call — a wrong one here formats with a different ruff than the gate.
{
  "extensions": [
    "charliermarsh.ruff",
  ],
}
